\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE:Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Reiterates Open Capital Account Policy\b0\par\par\uc2 205 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 November 2008\par 04:59\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds background on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , loan boost to foreign reserves)\par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday reiterated that it has no plan to resort to capital controls following its announcement Wednesday limiting purchases of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  without underlying transactions.\par \par \uc2 "We are still committed to an open capital-account regime," Bank Indonesia Governor Boediono said in a press conference.\par \par \uc2 Boediono said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to be in the market to reduce exchange rate volatility. He, however, said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  "won't operate against the market."\par \par \uc2 "We will work along with the market movement in order to lessen volatility," he said.\par \par \uc2 Dealers said that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has recently reduced \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market after spending nearly $7 billion last month to support the rupiah, which has fallen 20% against the dollar since the beginning of the year.\par \par \uc2 Boediono said that the government will take a $2 billion offshore loan in December that will boost the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, which stood at $50.6 billion as of end-October.\par \par \uc2 -By Farida Husna, contributing to Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com [ 14-11-08 0359GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020081114e4be0004f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
