\par\par \b \uc2 Indonesian rupiah tumbles, CDS spikes on  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  rule\b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 2008\par 03:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE, Nov 13 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah shed another 3.8 percent of its value against the dollar on Thursday after a new rule on foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  outflows raised worries that the authorities are bracing for a steep fall in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The rupiah hit 11,950 per dollar, its weakest since April 2001, at which level state banks were seen selling dollars. Traders suspected the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday that purchases of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Indonesia above an equivalent of $100,000 per month must be supported by underlying transactions.[ID:nJAK262096]\par \par \uc2 "It's only documentation requirement," said Enrico Tanuwidjaja, a strategist at \uc2 OCBC Bank\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 But traders said the measure, while aimed at curbing naked speculation on the rupiah, revealed authorities' concern over the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and therefore spurred more rupiah selling.\par \par \uc2 "Investors' take on the move is still not very positive with widening CDS this morning," Tanuwidjaja said.\par \par \uc2 Indonesia 5-year CDS <INDONE5UA=GFI> widened by about 70 basis points to 750, but trading was illiquid with the offer at 900 basis points, according to a Hong Kong-based trader. (Reporting by Vidya Ranganathan and Rafael Nam; Editing by Kazunori Takada) ((vidya.ranganathan@thomsonreuters.com; +65-68703090; Reuters Messaging: vidya.ranganathan.reuters.com@reuters.net))\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDONESIA-RUPIAH (URGENT)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|IF|ABX|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020081113e4bd0004t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
