\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Indonesia to keep rph from fluctuating too much-c.bank\b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 September 2008\par 08:35\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes, details)\par \par \uc2 JAKARTA, Sept 11 (Reuters) - Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reiterated on Thursday that it would always "be in the market" to prevent the rupiah from fluctuating too much, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell to its lowest level against the dollar in over seven months.\par \par \uc2 The rupiah <IDR=> fell more than 1 percent to 9,475 per dollar on Thursday after it recorded its biggest one-day fall in 15 months on September 5, which dealers said had prompted Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BI) to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Rupiah weakening in the past few days is related to the repositioning of foreign investors' portfolios, as a result of the strengthening of the dollar. BI will always be in the market to keep the rupiah from fluctuating too much," Budi Mulya, a deputy governor, told Reuters in a mobile text message.\par \par \uc2 The rupiah strengthened slightly to 9,420 a dollar at 0715 GMT following Mulya's remark.\par \par \uc2 Concerns over \uc2 Lehman Brothers\uc2 ' ability to raise capital and broader anxiety about global growth pushed the dollar to a one-year high against the euro <EUR=> and weighed on high-yielding \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  such as the Australian dollar <AUD=>.\par \par \uc2 Other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , such as the South Korean won, also bore the brunt of receding risk appetite. (Reporting by Adriana Nina Kusuma, writing by Andreas Ismar, editing by Sara Webb)\par \par \uc2 INDONESIA-ECONOMY/RUPIAH (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|IF|SI|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080911e49b000e7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
