\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE:Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 :To Tame CPI With Rate Hikes, \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 552 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Mai 2008\par 09:49\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds background and analysts' rate predictions)\par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Bank Indonesia officials Wednesday hinted of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's readiness to further hike its benchmark one-month interest rate and possibly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to combat inflation, a day after it raised the benchmark rate by 25 basis points.\par \par \uc2 "What we do to tame inflation include raising the interest rate, stabilizing the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and optimizing money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Bank Indonesia's Deputy Governor Budi Mulya told reporters on the sidelines of a banking event.\par \par \uc2 "The rupiah's stability is important (in containing inflation), as if it (the rupiah) is not under control, what we do on interest rate will be useless," Mulya added.\par \par \uc2 But when asked if Bank Indonesia will increase the key interest rate for sure, he said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will decide during monthly rate meetings.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Bank Indonesia's Senior Deputy Governor Miranda Goeltom told reporters at the same event that she predicts inflation to be above 9% at the end of the year, way above the top end of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's inflation target of 6%.\par \par \uc2 The comments came after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's quicker-than-expected reversal in its recent rate easing cycle that started in May 2006 and had resulted in total cuts of 475 basis points up till December 2007. Since then, the central had held the key rate unchanged at 8.00% until it raised the rate to 8.25% Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has previously been viewed as being reluctant to adopt monetary tightening on worries that such a policy will hurt economic growth, now seems to recognize the need to move preemptively to check rising inflation expectations, analysts said.\par \par \uc2 Further rate hikes - while not expected to bring the rate to above the inflation level - may be considered as inflation may rise further soon as the government plans to hike subsidized fuel prices by as much as 30%, probably early June, they added.\par \par \uc2 Most analysts predict that the Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will raise its benchmark rate to between 8.75% and 9% by the end of the year. But \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  forecast more aggressive hikes of 75-100 basis points in addition to the 25-basis-point hike Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 Expecting a total of 75 basis points of hikes over the next three months, Standard Chartered has forecast for Bank Indonesia to deliver a 25-basis-point hike each when it meets June 5, July 3, and August 5.\par \par \uc2 Bank Danamon predicts the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will hike its rate to 8.75% in June after the fuel price hike is implemented, before raising the rate further to 9% later this year.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  has, however, suggested that Bank Indonesia should take a more aggressive stance.\par \par \uc2 "Although growth is likely to moderate this year, inflation is the more pressing issue at hand," it said in a research note Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 It added that there are also upside risks to its interest rate forecast in the event investors exit Indonesian assets as higher inflation threatens stability. Consequently, this could force Bank Indonesia to push rates higher to stem capital outflows.\par \par \uc2 -By Farida Husna and I Made Sentana; Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com [ 07-05-08 0749GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080507e457000h6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
