\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia central bank intervened \highlight\uc2  on Friday-deputy   \b0\par\par\uc2 302 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 November 2007\par 03:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds details, quotes)   \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA, Nov 19 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday to prop up the rupiah <IDR=> \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is prepared to take more action if necessary, deputy governor Hartadi Sarwono told Reuters on Monday.   \par \par \uc2 Sarwono also repeated that falls in the rupiah, Asia's worst performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year, were likely to be temporary.   \par \par \uc2 The rupiah rose as far as 9,278 per dollar on Monday, up almost 0.5 percent from late Asian trade on Friday, as investor sentiment stabilised after last week's sharp sell-off due to concerns about the health of the U.S. economy.   \par \par \uc2 Asked to confirm market speculations that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday, Sarwono said : "Yes we did. There had been some sort of panic in the market. Even though the amount was small, it has had an impact."   \par \par \uc2 The high-yielding rupiah recovered to 9,320 per dollar in late trade on Friday after falling to as low as 9,405 earlier in the day, after Sarwono promised to support the ailing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 The rupiah has fallen about 3 percent versus the dollar so far this year.   \par \par \uc2 Asked whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  further to strengthen the rupiah, Sarwono said : "We will continue to take the necessary steps in regards to monetary policy and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 . This is a matter of (market) sentiment."   \par \par \uc2 "Everything is going to be fine. I think by doing that, it will have a positive impact to prevent panic," Sarwono said, referring to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent sharp fluctuations in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.   \par \par \uc2 He declined to elaborate.   \par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Adriana Nina Kusuma, editing by Ed Davies)   \par \par \uc2 INDONESIA-ECONOMY/RUPIAH (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|IF|M|D|ABX|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020071119e3bj00043\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
