of last week, following \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the rupiah, a Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  deputy governor said.   \par \par \uc2  - - - -   \par \par \uc2  INVESTOR DAILY   \par \par \uc2  - BANK CAPITAL DELAYS IPO PLAN   \par \par \uc2  Indonesia's PT Bank Capital Tbk, will delay its plan for an initial public offering from an earlier schedule in August, due to volatile market conditions, an underwriter said.   \par \par \uc2  - - - -  ($1 = 9,400 rupiah)     \par \par \uc2 PRESS-INDONESIA-BUSINESS|LANGEN|G|RBN|REVU|IF|ABN|E|RNP|DNP|PGE|PCO|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070828e38s0001q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
