\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Indonesia c.bank governor sees rupiah at 9,000/dlr   \b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 August 2007\par 05:27\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds details, quotes)   \par \par \uc2 DENPASAR, \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Aug 22 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the rupiah <IDR=> and expects the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stabilise at around 9,000 per dollar in coming weeks, governor Burhanuddin Abdullah said on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 The rupiah, Asia's worst performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year, has been hit hard in recent weeks as investors continued to shun high-yielding but riskier emerging market assets, such as the rupiah, because of concern about U.S. credit market problems.   \par \par \uc2 The rupiah was quoted at around 9,435 per dollar at 0340 GMT on Wednesday, little changed from its levels late on Tuesday. It has lost almost 5 percent against the dollar this year.   \par \par \uc2 "We have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  ... in a bid to stabilise (the rupiah). I think the possibility is that a new equilibrium will be reached in the coming weeks. I think it will continue to be at around 9,000 levels," Abdullah said.   \par \par \uc2 The governor made the remarks to reporters after attending a swearing-in ceremony at a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  office in Denpasar in the resort island of Bali.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it is comfortable with the rupiah in a range of between 8,500-9,500 per dollar.   \par \par \uc2 The state budget does not give a forecast for the year-end rupiah rate, but it has predicted the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will average 9,100 per dollar this year and next year.   \par \par \uc2 INDONESIA-ECONOMY/RUPIAH (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|IF|M|D|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070822e38m0004j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
