\par\par \b \uc2 Indonesian rupiah steady but lags regional  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  rally   \b0\par\par\uc2 224 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 August 2007\par 06:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE, Aug 13 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah stabilised against the dollar on Monday after its heavy fall in previous sessions, but it lagged a rally in other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the view that it is still a risky asset.   \par \par \uc2 The rupiah <IDR=> stayed around 9,345 per dollar, down 3.2 percent in just over two weeks and close to Friday's one-year trough of 9,365.   \par \par \uc2 Other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  such as the Philippine peso <PHP=> and Korean won <KRW=> rallied as investors tentatively bought some Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  after central banks over the world pumped money into troubled credit markets.   \par \par \uc2 The rupiah, Asia's highest-yielding \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , is the worst performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Asia this year.   \par \par \uc2 "It looks like it has stabilised this morning," said a trader in Jakarta.   \par \par \uc2 "I think the market is a bit worried. But Bank Indonesia said they will try hard to defend the rupiah from here, so the market is content about that."   \par \par \uc2 He added that he felt the markets were trying to play it safe and that the rupiah remained risky.   \par \par \uc2 Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it will try to minimise volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was suspected of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the rupiah last week.   \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 INDONESIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /RUPIAH|LANGEN|ABN|M   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070813e38d0008x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
