\par\par \b \uc2 Bank Indonesia:USD/IDR May Sink Below 9,000 Level In '07  \b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Dezember 2006\par 07:16\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The U.S. dollar may sink to below the IDR9,000 level in 2007 due to Indonesia's increasingly positive macroeconomic fundamentals, a senior Bank Indonesia official said Friday.  \par \par \uc2 But the dollar is unlikely to tumble as low as the IDR8,000 level, Bank Indonesia Deputy Governor Aslim Tadjuddin told reporters.  \par \par \uc2 "The rupiah is affected by our fundamental (macroeconomic) factors so the better our fundamentals, the better the rupiah (against the greenback)," Tadjuddin said  \par \par \uc2 Tadjuddin said that Bank Indonesia doesn't want the rupiah to "over-strengthen" because it would undermine the competitiveness of \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's exports, without elaborating on possible \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stall the rupiah's rise.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar was at IDR9,077 at 0630 GMT. [ 22-12-06 0631GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 The comments echo Bank Indonesia's forecast Monday that the dollar would likely trade in a band of IDR9,000-9,500 in 2007.  \par \par \uc2 Indonesia's improving macroeconomic outlook includes declining inflation and an ongoing easing in monetary policy.  \par \par \uc2 The government of President Susilo Bambang Yudhoyono has projected economic growth of 6.3% in 2007 compared with 5.8% in 2006. The economy expanded 5.6% last year.  \par \par \uc2 Tadjuddin said he was confident that a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  target of around $45 billion in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves by end-2007 was achievable due to Indonesia's robust trade performance.  \par \par \uc2 Indonesia's reserves stood at $41.5 billion at end-November from $39.9 billion a month earlier, Bank Indonesia spokesman Budi Mulia said earlier this month.  \par \par \uc2 -By Farida Husna contributing to Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 2983 1277; phelim.kyne@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Michael Kitchen [ 22-12-06 0703GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020061222e2cm0005o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
