\par\par \b \uc2 Bk Indonesia:"Not Overly Concerned" About Thai Baht Rise  \b0\par\par\uc2 516 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Dezember 2006\par 05:25\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Bank Indonesia is so far "not overly concerned" about potential spillover effects from the recent surge in the value of the Thai baht and the Bank of Thailand's measures to clamp down on speculative inflows, a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the rupiah if there is "huge pressure" on the local unit, Bank Indonesia Senior Deputy Governor Miranda Gultom said.  \par \par \uc2 "In an open economy and with an open capital account policy, we have to observe the market reaction to the Bank of Thailand announcement," Gultom said.  \par \par \uc2 "Up to now, it's clear that we have confidence that the...(domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) structure is still healthy," Gultom said.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar was trading at IDR9,124 at 0445 GMT, down from an interday high of IDR9,128, but considerably higher than the Monday closing of IDR9,084. [ 19-12-06 0452GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Gultom's comments reflect how Asian central bankers remain painfully cognizant of the lessons of the 1997-98 Asian financial crisis when massive, sudden movements in speculative inflows caused regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to plummet against the U.S. dollar.  \par \par \uc2 The Bank of Thailand from Tuesday has imposed new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls to prevent the baht from appreciating sharply after speculative inflows pushed the unit to a nine-year high.  \par \par \uc2 Indonesia is particularly sensitive to the impact of speculative capital after emerging market risk aversion in May prompted a sudden short-term reversal in inflows estimated at $1 billion per month. That reversal caused the rupiah to tumble 5.5% against the dollar that month before rebounding.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said Indonesian state banks began selling dollars early Tuesday in a move that appeared to be aimed at counteracting dollar purchases by market participants spooked by the sharp movement in the Thai baht.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar selling appeared to reflect an official desire to keep the rupiah relatively stable against the dollar in the symbolically important year-end period, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a policy of not commenting on its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 Gultom indicated that it was still too soon to adequately evaluate the wider regional impact of recent events in Thailand.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is confident that an improvement in Indonesia's investment environment will convert an increasing proportion of speculative inflows into long-term foreign direct investment next year, Gultom said.  \par \par \uc2 Gultom said that conversion of that speculative capital into meaningful FDI will require the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the Indonesian government to ensure that "all (investment) projects in the pipeline waiting for finance" are available for investors.  \par \par \uc2 "We think we are sure of the likelihood of some of the inflows being converted into FDI in 2007," she said.  \par \par \uc2 The Indonesian government unveiled in November 10 "model" infrastructure projects valued at $4.4 billion designed to entice investors to commit to long-term investment in the country.  \par \par \uc2 -By Phelim Kyne; Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 3983 1277; phelim.kyne@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Graham Norris and Mary de Wet [ 19-12-06 0542GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020061219e2cj0003d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
