\par\par \b \uc2 Bk Indonesia Gov: USD Seen At Around IDR9,000 To End '06  \b0\par\par\uc2 329 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 August 2006\par 08:30\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Macroeconomic conditions provide the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  "room" to cut its benchmark one-month rate again next month, Bank Indonesia Governor Burhanuddin Abdullah said Friday. "There is room (for a September rate cut)," Abdullah told reporters. He said the bank would monitor softening on-year inflation movements before making any monetary policy decisions.  \par \par \uc2 But Abdullah shied away from predicting a repeat of the 50-basis point cut in the benchmark rate that the bank announced last week.  \par \par \uc2 "We have to be very careful (about the pace of monetary easing)," he said. [ 11-08-06 0652GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Adbullah's comments, which echo those Thursday by Bank Indonesia Senior Deputy Governor Miranda Gultom about the likelihood of additional benchmark rate cuts, will heighten market anticipation of further monetary loosening next month.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decision last week to bring the rate down to 11.75% from 12.25% was the third and deepest interest rate cut since Bank Indonesia initiated monetary policy easing in May.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts expect the benchmark Bank Indonesia one-month rate to reach 11.00% by end-2006 in line with a decline in on-year inflation to around 8.0% in the same period.  \par \par \uc2 Abdullah also indicated that Bank Indonesia will aim to keep the U.S. dollar from falling below the IDR9,000 mark.  \par \par \uc2 "It seems the rupiah will be around 9,000 up to the end of the year, I think the trend is like that," he said.  \par \par \uc2 That statement is in line with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy to avoid references to \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but supports the government's aim to keep \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's exports competitive.  \par \par \uc2 At 0725 GMT, the dollar was at IDR9,085, up from an intraday trading low of IDR9,045.  \par \par \uc2 -By Farida Husna, Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 3983 1277; phelim.kyne@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Ven Ram and Mary de Wet [ 11-08-06 0737GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020060811e28b000de\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
