\par\par \b \uc2 DJ Indonesia Rupiah Ends 1.1% Down On Dollar's Regional Rise  \b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Mai 2006\par 12:18\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2006, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah lost a further 1.1% to the dollar Monday amid the U.S. unit's strong rally against the yen and other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar closed at IDR9,300, versus its close Friday at IDR9,200.  \par \par \uc2 'The dollar-rupiah is tracking the dollar's rise to above Y112,' a dealer with a foreign bank said.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was suspected of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  via state banks to slow the dollar's rise. They said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  likely sold dollars between IDR9,325 and IDR9,350.  \par \par \uc2 The stock market, meanwhile, ended 6% lower at 1,309.045 points as foreign investors exited the Indonesian market amid weakness on regional bourses, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The selloffs in the stock market may further drive the greenback higher during the rest of the week as foreign investors will likely use their rupiah to buy the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 'There is a big potential for the dollar to rise to IDR9,500 over the next three days if the regional stock markets don't recover,' a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said that Vice President Jusuf Kalla's statement Friday that IDR9,200-IDR9,500 is the 'normal' range for the dollar may embolden market participants to test IDR9,500 in the coming days.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers set IDR9,200 and IDR9,500 as the possible range for the dollar Tuesday, but still expect Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent the greenback from breaking the psychologically important level. -By I Made Sentana; Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Graham Norris  \par \par \uc2 -0-   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020060522e25m006he\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
