\par\par \b \uc2 Indonesian rupiah stays near 1-yr high on inflows  \b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2006\par 03:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE, March 2 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah was trading on Thursday just shy of a one-year peak hit on Wednesday, with sentiment boosted by the response to a sovereign bond issue but the upside capped by fear of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The rupiah <IDR=> was quoted at 9,185/9,190 per dollar, just off Wednesday's high of 9,150, having gained more than 1.8 percent in a week.  \par \par \uc2 Traders in Jakarta said increasing interest from foreign investors in high-yielding rupiah assets was supporting the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 But a Singapore-based trader said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , had been seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  around the 9,200 level this week to rein in the rupiah, which had made the market wary.  \par \par \uc2 "Emerging market carry is broadly doing well. The Turkish lira, Brazilian real and South African rand are looking bid, so there's plenty of appetite for carry," said Mirza Baig, Deutsche Bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist.  \par \par \uc2 A twin sovereign dollar bond offering from Indonesia had attracted $8 billion of subscriptions so far, market sources told Reuters on Thursday. Pricing is expected later in the day.  \par \par \uc2 Indonesia has not fixed how much it plans to raise from the bond sale, but the response is more than 5 times initial market expectations for the size of the offering.  \par \par \uc2 Baig said sentiment on the rupiah had improved on the news, particularly on expectations some of the proceeds may be converted into rupiah.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDONESIA-RUPIAH|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|IF|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060302e23200050\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
